      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Age Verification can be done with something like a drivers license instead of a credit card since that would make alot of people leave VRC because they wouldn't trust that type of system.\n\nUpgrading the engine wouldn't do anything since what you're talking about is Content Creation, VRC allows the creator to change gravity & script using Udon, the world being how it is is purely on the creator.\n\nText to image ai: no\n\nCommands in the chatbox can be done Via OSC pretty easily ngl.\n\nRelationship status & gender can be written in your Bio or Status itself so the feature being added would go unused by alot of people most likely.\n\nDesktop players having bad collision means the world isnt created with desktop players in mind so you could try to contact the creator to get that fixed. (normally it should be fine as VRC makes things pretty well even if a world didnt have Desktop in mind) if you could give an example of a world that has a issue with desktop players but not VR players that'd be nice.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
