      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Multiple suggestions in a post is good for generalized discussion, but kind of hard to use for tracking things, so the guidelines that they ask you to read before posting a feature request mention\n\n> If you have multiple feature requests, please separate them into individual posts for each request\n\nThat object detection AI is trained towards object recognition, for tracking you'd want an AI trained towards recognizing people, and specifics about their body, and do it with low latency.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
