  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-05-25T16:51:57.502Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "*Tracking per Camera:\n\nhttps://arstechnica.com/information-technology/2023/04/meta-introduces-ai-model-that-can-isolate-and-mask-objects-within-images/\n\nSuch a AI Model can be moddified for tracking. Add up the old Xbox connect software with upgrades, used without Trackers in VrChat.\n\n*Age Verfication trough Credit Card Purcharse (3th Party Handler for Anonymity) and Birthday Verfication. Create Worlds in with only 21+ can join.\n\n*Upgrade the Engine to have a more realistic Physics and Graphics. (Keep a Container of the Old Engine to make the Avaters work. A container would be work as a Transcriptor for the new Engine(Beta Option as choice).\n\n*Text to Image AI Generator can be used for easy Character creation. You could add up a Character creator seperated from VRChat.\n\n*Commands into Text Chat for changing the Dynamic of the Game into something different. Example: \\Battle for fighting in a Battle for Points. Teams are split in 2 at any server. Others are not affected.\n\n*Relationship Statues should be show in Profil and the Nameplate. Allow easier interaction if there is choice for a Dating (on search) Statues. Allow linking to Dating Sites/Apps.\n\n*Allow Gender to choose in Profil as Optional.\n\n*Desktop players have no collision with a lot of Object. How to resolve that?",
